{
  "id": "policy-query",
  "description": "制度查询与合规判断",
  "model": {
    "role": "main"
  },
  "thinkingLevel": "medium",
  "toolset": "policy-query",
  "tools": [
    "search_policy",
    "search_cases",
    "enumerate_clauses",
    "get_clause_detail",
    "assess_sufficiency"
  ],
  "systemPrompt": "policy-query/system.md",
  "skills": [
    "policy-query/skills/citation-discipline.md",
    "policy-query/skills/scenario-to-rule.md",
    "policy-query/skills/evidence-standard.md",
    "policy-query/skills/policy-validity.md"
  ],
  "appendSystemPrompt": ["policy-query/output-format.md"],
  "compaction": {
    "enabled": true,
    "reserveTokens": 16384,
    "keepRecentTokens": 20000
  },
  "limits": {
    "maxTurns": 30,
    "runTimeoutMs": 900000,
    "maxTotalTokens": 3000000,
    "maxCostUsd": 0.5
  },
  "stopPolicy": {
    "name": "sufficiency-gate",
    "options": {
      "maxProbes": 2
    }
  },
  "resultPolicy": {
    "name": "result-budget",
    "$comment": "护栏口径,当前语料下**不触发**。真环境实测(query=\"上市公司大股东通过集中竞价减持股份,需要提前多久预披露?\",corpus_types=[\"external\"],与 Task 15f 同一道已验证切题的问题):search_policy 8 条 / 2109 字符(qcfg.topk=8 封顶,agent 控制不了,只有把 topk 调到 >12 才会触发)· get_clause_detail(一次取全 8 个 clause_id)5491 字符 · enumerate_clauses 50 条 / 10638 字符(qcfg.enumerate_topk=50 封顶,同样是配置项而非语料量,只有调大该配置才会触发)· search_cases 无实测(cases 表 0 行,恒零命中,阈值随 search_policy 定)。阈值 = 实测 × 1.4,向上取整到百位,余量留给语料扩大与检索排序抖动。enumerate_clauses 单条返回的字符数(10638)远超 search_policy 的量级 —— 若挂在 maxChars.default(为 search_policy/search_cases 校准的 3000)下会导致 enumerate_clauses 的正常输出被截断,所以单独给它一个 maxChars.enumerate_clauses 键,不共用 default。截断能力的凭证在 test/result-budget.test.ts 的构造用例,不靠真语料触发 —— 压到真语料会截的值会截掉真依据,直接伤 §8.2 的答案质量。",
    "options": {
      "maxHits": {
        "search_policy": 12,
        "search_cases": 12,
        "enumerate_clauses": 70
      },
      "maxChars": {
        "get_clause_detail": 7700,
        "enumerate_clauses": 14900,
        "default": 3000
      }
    }
  },
  "outputContract": {
    "schema": "policy-query/output-contract.schema.json",
    "maxRepairAttempts": 2
  },
  "observability": {
    "contextSnapshot": "hash"
  },
  "mcpServers": [
    {
      "id": "policy-query",
      "command": "${DFZQ_AUDIT_AI_PYTHON}",
      "args": [
        "-m",
        "query.mcp.server"
      ],
      "cwd": "${DFZQ_AUDIT_AI_ROOT}",
      "env": {
        "PIPELINE_CONFIG_DIR": "${PIPELINE_CONFIG_DIR}",
        "POLICY_MCP_AUDIT_LOG": "${POLICY_MCP_AUDIT_LOG}",
        "HF_HUB_OFFLINE": "1",
        "PATH": "${PATH}"
      }
    }
  ]
}
